<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Ciutadella regular&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 40px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img alt="Qantas" border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2031794577/QBR+email+header.jpg" title="Qantas" width="680" style="display: block; width: 680px; height: 70px;"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Thank you for your time on the phone today.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h3" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px;">Updating your Account Manager:</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">If you would like to change the account manager, have the existing Account Manager send an email from the email address they currently have listed within the Qantas Business Rewards account. The email needs to contain a written authorisation on company letterhead, hand signed by the existing Account Manager with the new Account Manager name, email address, contact phone number and Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number (if they have one).</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h3" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px;">But what if the current Account Manager has already left the business?</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Alternatively, if the current Account Manager for Qantas Business Rewards is no longer with the business, the business owner, director, CEO or authorised senior executive may send a letter request via email on signed company letterhead, with the requested information (listed above). It may take up to two business days to change the Account Manager, once the email request has been received.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Before activating the change of Account Manager, we will also send an email to the existing Account Manager, and requester if separate, seeking confirmation of the change request.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">If you can please include the above information specific to your situation and reply back to&nbsp;<a class="seven" href="mailto:qantasbusinessrewards@qantas.com.au" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">qantasbusinessrewards@qantas.com.au</a>, we can organise for your changes to occur.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h3" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px;">Updating your email address:</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">To simply change or update the email address linked to your Qantas Business Rewards account, please call our dedicated Qantas Business Rewards Service Centre on 13 74 78, or chat to one of our Agents via webchat on&nbsp;<a class="seven" href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">qantasbusinessrewards.com</a>. Upon verification of your identity, you can advise the Service Centre Agent of the new email address you would like linked to your account. The Agent will then send an email to the new email address for you to set up a new password.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">If you have any questions, or for further assistance please call the Qantas Business Rewards service centre on 13 74 78.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Sincerely,<br>Your Qantas Business Rewards Team</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>